<title>INDIA: Internet addresses of India Finance Ministry officials.</title>
<headline>Internet addresses of India Finance Ministry officials.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the Internet addresses of some senior officials of India's Finance Ministry.</p>
<p>    Finance Minister	 --   fm@finance.delhi.nic.in</p>
<p>    Finance Secretary	--   finsecy@finance.delhi.nic.in</p>
<p>    Chief Economic Adviser --   cea@finance.delhi.nic.in</p>
<p>    Revenue Secretary	--   rs@finance.delhi.nic.in</p>
<p>    Expenditure Secretary  --   esecy@finance.delhi.nic.in</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom+91-11-301 2024</p>
